      "side": 1,
      "message": "We don\u0027t know why you\u0027re blocking the reflection of vhs in android14-5.15.\nVH is necessary for vendor-specific work that cannot be upstreamed, and it is not code that can be upstreamed.(Bug: 317281245) To support backward compatibility, please reflect the existing vh in android14-5.15.\nAnd even when upgrading the kernel version, please keep the existing vh.",
      "parentUuid": "8a9b3f65_170b0c18",
